Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|false|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Rules|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: View Web Content In Sample Drools
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|osgi.modules.includes|portal-rules-engine-sample-web|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User goto Edit CP
		|userScreenName|test|
	And Organization goto Identification CP
	And Organization add Address CP
		|orgAddressCity|Diamond Bar|
		|orgAddressCountry|United States|
		|orgAddressPostal|91765|
		|orgAddressRegion|California|
		|orgAddressStreet|1400 Montefino Ave|
		|orgAddressType|Personal|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|americas|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add With Tag CP
		|tagNameList|americas|
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|pageName|Drools Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Drools Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Sample Drools|
	Then WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|